OL,3,GNEWSAWest Country accent 'would not
OL,4,Ahave worked for Oasis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis would not have worked if the band
OL,7,Fhad "a West Country accent", Noel
OL,8,FGallagher has said.
OL,10,FHe made the claim in a new documentary,
OL,11,F'Oasis: Don't Look Back in Anger',
OL,12,Fwhich tells the story of the band's
OL,13,Freformation and comeback tour after 15
OL,14,Fyears apart.
OL,16,FTalking about the importance of the
OL,17,Fband's Manchester roots, Gallagher
OL,18,Fsaid: "Imagine if I had a West Country
OL,19,Faccent saying 'we are going be the
OL,20,Fbiggest band in the world'. It's not
OL,21,Fgonna work."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
