OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWest Country accent 'would not
OL,4,Ahave worked for Oasis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite his comment, Oasis does
OL,7,Freportedly have a West Country
OL,8,Fconnection. A long-held rumour suggests
OL,9,Ftheir name was inspired by Swindon's
OL,10,FOasis Leisure Centre, which hosted a
OL,11,Fgig which Gallagher worked on as a
OL,12,Fguitar technician.
